@ 17.7.2.1.10 - Old English to Scots
# citation: Marcas Brian MacStiofáin Ó Mhaitiú Ó Domhnaill, from personal research NB: This is an alternate listing of sound changes from Old English to Scots presented by a native speaker, which leads into a listing of sound changes to the Falkirk dialect.
